sequenceDiagram
    participant InsightsAPI as 🟢 Insights API
    participant ConAPI as 🔵 Consumption API
    participant AppAPI as 🟠 Appliances API
    participant PredictionAPI as 🟡 Prediction API

    InsightsAPI->>ConAPI: GET /consumption/pattern
    ConAPI-->>InsightsAPI: {high_consumption_hours: [18-21]}
    InsightsAPI->>AppAPI: GET /appliances/top-consumers<br/>{household_id}
    AppAPI-->>InsightsAPI: [{AC: 150kWh}, {Refrigerador: 120kWh}]
    InsightsAPI->>PredictionAPI: POST /recommendations<br/>{consumption_pattern, appliances}
    PredictionAPI-->>InsightsAPI: [{text: "Usar AC 2h menos",<br/>potential_savings: 10kWh}]
